---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Affiliate disclosure | SaveAndPlay"
  description="How SaveAndPlay earns commissions from affiliate links, and what that means for the deals we show."
>
  <main class="page">
    <div class="eyebrow">Legal</div>
    <h1>Affiliate disclosure</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: October 1, 2026</p>

    <div class="callout">
      <strong>In short:</strong> some links on SaveAndPlay are affiliate links. If you buy through them, we may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
    </div>

    <h2>How affiliate links work</h2>
    <p>SaveAndPlay takes part in affiliate programs run by game stores and affiliate networks. When you click a link to a store on our site and then make a purchase, the store may pay us a commission. The price you pay is the same as it would be without our link.</p>

    <h2>What this means for the deals we show</h2>
    <p>We aim to show real discounts from established stores. Commissions help pay for running the site. They don't change the prices you see, and we don't hide a good deal because a store doesn't pay us.</p>
    <p>Some links on the site may not be affiliate links. Where we can, we tell you which store a deal comes from, so you can check the offer yourself.</p>

    <h2>Prices and availability</h2>
    <p>Prices, discounts and offers change often. The price shown on SaveAndPlay may be out of date by the time you click. Always check the final price on the store's page before you buy. The store is responsible for the sale, delivery and support.</p>

    <h2>Questions</h2>
    <p>If anything here is unclear, please <a class="text-link" href="/contact/">contact us</a>.</p>
  </main>
</Layout>
